{"id":"861921fca45ede26","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-pr-closed-under-primec.md","title":"fact-pr-closed-under-primec — PR Closed Under Primitive Recursion","display":"fact-pr-closed-under-primec — PR Closed Under Primitive Recursion","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-pr-closed-under-primec","aliases":["92-fact-pr-closed-under-primec"],"display":"fact-pr-closed-under-primec — PR Closed Under Primitive Recursion","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-pr-closed-under-primec"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-pr-closed-under-primec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-pr-closed-under-primec — PR Closed Under Primitive Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (function parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> (primitive-recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}primec}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\bigr)\\;\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}primec}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\bigr)\\;\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原始递归函数在原始递归运算下封闭</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>（基函数）和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>（步函数）是PR，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>也是PR</li>\n<li>证明：原始递归运算是PR定义的允许运算之一</li>\n<li>这保证了递归定义的函数保持PR性质</li>\n<li>加法、乘法、指数都由此构造</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ (primitive-recursion operator, see [[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closed\\text{-}under\\text{-}primec}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\bigr)\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\bigl(\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\bigr)\\;\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in\\mathrm{PR}.","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1285,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","cc110e19a2eae4ea"]}